{"chapter-slug":"rw6-61 L","paragraph":34,"wording":"[Archer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"bird","holder-quote":"Mrsha stared at the Cyprail Grasstalker, which she recognized by its camouflaged appearance, but also by the distinctive two pale white-yellow, long tail feathers on its backside it would wiggle in the grass to attract smaller birds or insects—upon which it would turn and consume its prey. She looked up at Bird. The [Archer] nodded solemnly, watching it.","id":"c82e28fe-28e1-55b0-95f8-b0b231fd1d31"}
